# ── Data lives outside git (2.3 GB; archived as separate tarballs) ───────────
# Raw .xls tracking files, aggregated data, posterior draws, and figures are all
# regenerable or too large for git. See MANIFEST.md for what's archived where.
Data/
# Stale/backup data trees that are not part of the project (orphan snapshots).
Data_old/
Data_*/

# ── Python / R scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.RData
.Rhistory
*.Rproj.user

# ── Local scratch / job-tracking artifacts ──────────────────────────────────
check
finomena_bundles/

# ── Unpublished manuscript drafts / internal notes (kept outside this repo) ──
# These live elsewhere; the rules are a safety net so a stray copy is never
# committed by accident.
RESCUE_SCREEN_PAPER_NOTES.md
FORMULA_SELECTION_SUPPLEMENT.md
*_PAPER_NOTES.md
*_SUPPLEMENT.md

# ── OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
